# Summary

1. Soft emission off an external line gives e(p·ε)/(p·k).

2. Charge conservation makes the factor gauge invariant.

3. Phase space of unresolved photons produces log(ΔE/λ).

4. Virtual IR logs cancel real ones; the remainder depends on the detector.

